  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 3.82,
      "e": 9.82,
      "text": "It was a beautiful day so we decided to go out fishing, you know, friends and family."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.82,
      "e": 14.42,
      "text": "So we ended up catching some sand eps."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.42,
      "e": 20.38,
      "text": "We ended up by the aquarium and finally our boat engine gave up."
    },
    {
      "s": 20.38,
      "e": 24.14,
      "text": "So we tried all our best but we couldn't."
    },
    {
      "s": 24.14,
      "e": 30.42,
      "text": "So we had to call the coast guard and finally they came up and towed us away."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.42,
      "e": 35.62,
      "text": "The other thing was we were not too far away so we weren't scared of anything."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.62,
      "e": 40.62,
      "text": "We disclosed by to the wharf so it was cool."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.62,
      "e": 49.42,
      "text": "We had everything that is required to have in a boat like fire extinguishers, flares,"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.42,
      "e": 54.58,
      "text": "flashlights, life jacket, throw balls, everything that is required."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.58,
      "e": 56.22,
      "text": "Yeah, we had everything."
    },
    {
      "s": 56.22,
      "e": 59.22,
      "text": "So where did you guys run into trouble?"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.22,
      "e": 62.02,
      "text": "Next to the red buoy out there."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.02,
      "e": 63.22,
      "text": "Which buoy is that?"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.22,
      "e": 65.02,
      "text": "It's buoy number four."
    }
  ],
